  "index": 2,
  "url": "https://app.programiz.pro/course/javascript-interactivity/selecting-changing-content?page=3",
  "title": "Changing Text and HTML",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Course: Make Your Website Interactive with JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "Changing Text and HTML"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "You have selected the element. Now, let's change what is inside it."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "There are two ways to do that. And knowing the difference matters."
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        "textContent",
        "innerHTML"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Let's see them side by side."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<!DOCTYPE html>\n2<html lang=\"en\">\n3<head>\n4  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n5  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n6  <title>Changing Content</title>\n7  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n8</head>\n9<body>\n10\n11  <h1>Changing Content Example</h1>\n12\n13  <p id=\"text-demo\">(text)</p>\n14  <p id=\"html-demo\">(html)</p>\n15\n16  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n17</body>\n18</html>"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "css",
      "content": "1body {\n2  font-family: sans-serif;\n3  padding: 20px;\n4}\n5\n6h1 {\n7  margin-bottom: 20px;\n8}\n9\n10p {\n11  font-size: 18px;\n12  margin-bottom: 10px;\n13}"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "content": "1var textEl = document.querySelector('#text-demo');\n2var htmlEl = document.querySelector('#html-demo');\n3\n4if (textEl) {\n5  textEl.textContent = 'This is plain text';\n6}\n7\n8if (htmlEl) {\n9  htmlEl.innerHTML = 'This has <strong>bold</strong> text';\n10}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Click Run Code."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The first paragraph shows plain text. The second paragraph shows bold formatting. Same pattern, different result."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Here is why."
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        "textContent treats everything as text.",
        "innerHTML treats the value as HTML."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "alt": "Idea Emoji",
      "src": "data:image/png;base64,"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Most of the time, textContent is the better and safer choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Next is a quick quiz to check your understanding."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": "How does it work?"
